{"unit_id":"RyanZhangK__dsh-paper-translate#card-zh","repo":"RyanZhangK/dsh-paper-translate","commit":"e34d52d94aa03659dbfd814ec3440c4e1abc719f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paper-translate 是面向 DSH 的 PDF 论文翻译工具：它把 BabelDOC 注册为 paper_translate 工具，可先检查环境并估算 token 与费用，再将论文输出为原文译文交替版和纯译文版。它支持指定页码、目标语言、输出目录及按领域复用术语表，也会汇报实际用量。适合需要阅读外文研究论文的用户；需自行准备 BabelDOC 与其配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-42","lib/index.js:48-57","lib/index.js:112-133"]}
{"unit_id":"RyanZhangK__dsh-paper-translate#card-en","repo":"RyanZhangK/dsh-paper-translate","commit":"e34d52d94aa03659dbfd814ec3440c4e1abc719f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-paper-translate adds a DSH tool that uses BabelDOC to translate research PDFs. It estimates token use and cost before running, then creates bilingual and translation-only PDFs. Users can select pages, language and output directory, reuse subject glossaries, and review actual token usage.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-42","lib/index.js:48-57","lib/index.js:112-133"]}
