{"unit_id":"RyanZhangK__dsh-paper-translate#feature-estimate","repo":"RyanZhangK/dsh-paper-translate","commit":"e34d52d94aa03659dbfd814ec3440c4e1abc719f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「翻译前成本预估」：根据 PDF 页数、模型和术语表状态估算 token 与参考费用。调用 paper_translate 时设置 dryRun=true，只检查环境并返回估算，不启动翻译。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96-113","lib/estimate.js:57-95"]}
{"unit_id":"RyanZhangK__dsh-paper-translate#feature-bilingual","repo":"RyanZhangK/dsh-paper-translate","commit":"e34d52d94aa03659dbfd814ec3440c4e1abc719f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「论文双语翻译」：调用 BabelDOC 翻译 PDF，并生成原文与译文交替的双语文件及纯译文文件。调用 paper_translate 并提供 PDF 绝对路径，可选目标语言、页码范围和输出目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:66-77","lib/index.js:116-133","lib/translate.js:108-117"]}
{"unit_id":"RyanZhangK__dsh-paper-translate#feature-glossary","repo":"RyanZhangK/dsh-paper-translate","commit":"e34d52d94aa03659dbfd814ec3440c4e1abc719f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「领域术语表复用」：按 domain 保存并筛选术语表，翻译后将新抽取的词条合并回领域词表。调用 paper_translate 时指定领域；已有适用词表时复用而不重新抽取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:79-94","lib/index.js:199-215","lib/glossary.js:142-207"]}
{"unit_id":"RyanZhangK__dsh-paper-translate#feature-usage","repo":"RyanZhangK/dsh-paper-translate","commit":"e34d52d94aa03659dbfd814ec3440c4e1abc719f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「翻译用量回报」：翻译完成后解析 BabelDOC 日志并显示实际 token 用量、预估偏差及术语抽取用量；日志无法解析时会明确说明用量未知。此结果随翻译调用返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:165-197","lib/translate.js:120-167"]}
